<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="Read and save legal education materials on LexCitizen." />
    <title>Reading | LexCitizen</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/signin.css" />
    <script src="js/reader.js" defer></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/modern-ui.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/learning.css" />
</head>
  <body>
    <div class="app-shell signin-shell">
      <header class="site-header signin-header">
        <a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="LexCitizen home">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span>Lex<span class="brand-light">Citizen</span></span>
        </a>
        <nav class="dashboard-nav" aria-label="Reading navigation">
          <a href="user-dashboard.html">My library</a>
          <button class="outline-button" id="readerLogout" type="button">Sign out</button>
        </nav>
      </header>
      <main class="reader-page" id="readerPage">
        <a class="back-link" href="index.html">← Back to LexCitizen</a>
        <section class="reader-hero reveal-on-scroll" aria-labelledby="readerTitle">
          <div class="reader-hero-copy">
            <p class="section-eyebrow" id="readerCategory">Loading your reading…</p>
            <h1 id="readerTitle"></h1>
            <p class="reader-excerpt" id="readerExcerpt"></p>
            <div class="reader-meta">
              <span class="reader-meta-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span>
              <span id="readerReadingTime">A short, clear explainer</span>
              <span class="reader-meta-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span>Plain-language guide</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="reader-art" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 300 250" role="presentation">
              <circle class="reader-art-orbit" cx="156" cy="122" r="95" />
              <path class="reader-art-page" d="M92 48h91l34 34v120H92z" />
              <path class="reader-art-fold" d="M183 48v35h34" />
              <path class="reader-art-line" d="M111 108h72M111 126h87M111 144h62" />
              <circle class="reader-art-glass" cx="178" cy="150" r="34" />
              <path class="reader-art-handle" d="m202 176 25 26" />
              <path class="reader-art-spark" d="M63 77v18m-9-9h18M229 48v13m-7-6h14" />
              <circle class="reader-art-dot" cx="72" cy="166" r="5" />
            </svg>
            <span class="reader-art-caption">LEARN · PRACTICE · TEST</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <nav class="reader-jump-nav" aria-label="On this page">
          <a href="#readerBody">The explainer</a>
          <a href="#readerKeyIdeas">Key ideas</a>
          <a href="#readerAiStudyAids">AI study tools</a>
          <a href="#readerCheck">Practice &amp; test</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="reader-toolbar" aria-label="Reading controls">
          <div class="reader-progress-copy">
            <span class="reader-progress-label" id="readerProgressLabel">Your reading progress</span>
            <div class="reader-progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Reading progress" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0">
              <span id="readerProgressFill"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="reader-toolbar-actions">
            <div class="reader-font-controls" role="group" aria-label="Text size">
              <button id="readerTextSmaller" type="button" aria-label="Decrease text size">A−</button>
              <button id="readerTextLarger" type="button" aria-label="Increase text size">A+</button>
            </div>
            <button class="library-save-button" id="readerSave" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Save reading</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section class="reader-content-section reveal-on-scroll" aria-labelledby="readerBodyHeading">
          <div class="reader-section-heading">
            <p class="section-eyebrow">Take it one idea at a time</p>
            <h2 id="readerBodyHeading">The explainer</h2>
          </div>
          <article class="reader-body" id="readerBody"></article>
        </section>

        <section class="reader-learning-section reveal-on-scroll" id="readerKeyIdeas" aria-labelledby="readerKeyIdeasHeading">
          <div class="reader-section-heading">
            <p class="section-eyebrow">Remember the essentials</p>
            <h2 id="readerKeyIdeasHeading">Key ideas, made clear</h2>
            <p>Open a card to pause on one useful idea before you move on.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="reader-idea-grid" id="readerIdeaGrid"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="reader-ai-section reveal-on-scroll" id="readerAiStudyAids" aria-labelledby="readerAiStudyAidsHeading">
          <div class="reader-section-heading">
            <p class="section-eyebrow">Personal revision tools</p>
            <h2 id="readerAiStudyAidsHeading">Study with AI</h2>
            <p>Create a source-based summary, interactive flashcards, or short revision notes. Your generated materials are saved privately to your account.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="reader-ai-actions" role="group" aria-label="Choose an AI study tool">
            <button class="outline-button" type="button" data-ai-study-type="summary">Make a summary</button>
            <button class="outline-button" type="button" data-ai-study-type="flashcards">Create flashcards</button>
            <button class="outline-button" type="button" data-ai-study-type="notes">Make short notes</button>
          </div>
          <p class="reader-ai-disclaimer">AI-generated learning aids can be inaccurate and are not legal advice. Check important points against the official source. The selected reading text is sent to OpenAI to generate these aids.</p>
          <p class="reader-ai-signin" id="readerAiSignin" hidden>Sign in to generate and privately save study materials. <a id="readerAiSigninLink">Sign in</a></p>
          <p class="reader-ai-message" id="readerAiMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
          <div class="reader-ai-results" id="readerAiResults" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="reader-check-section reveal-on-scroll" id="readerCheck" aria-labelledby="readerCheckHeading" hidden>
          <div class="reader-check-intro">
            <span class="reader-check-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
            <div>
              <p class="section-eyebrow">Learn · practise · remember</p>
              <h2 id="readerCheckHeading">Practice, quiz &amp; test</h2>
              <p>Try a scenario, check the key idea, then take a short test. Your scores are saved to your learning dashboard.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="learning-stage-grid" id="readerAssessmentStages"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="reader-related-section reveal-on-scroll" id="readerRelated" aria-labelledby="readerRelatedHeading" hidden>
          <div class="reader-section-heading">
            <p class="section-eyebrow">Keep exploring</p>
            <h2 id="readerRelatedHeading">Your next reading</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="reader-related-grid" id="readerRelatedGrid"></div>
        </section>

        <aside class="reader-source reveal-on-scroll"><strong>For further reading</strong><p id="readerSource"></p><a id="readerSourceLink" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open source ↗</a></aside>
        <p class="reader-disclaimer">LexCitizen materials are for general educational purposes and are not legal advice. Verify current law and consult a qualified professional about a specific matter.</p>
        <div class="reader-end"><a class="solid-button" href="index.html#explore">Explore more guides <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
        <p class="reader-message" id="readerMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
      </main>
      <footer class="site-footer signin-footer"><span>LexCitizen</span><span>Learn the law. Live your rights.</span><span>India · Open knowledge project</span></footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
